{"id":"n27771-1-7","stage":0,"title":"원 · 韩元","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n27771-1-7-1","ko":"천 원만 빌려줘.","zh":"借我一千韩元就好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"천","meaning":"千，一千","explanation":"천：千，一千。","readings":[{"term":"천","audio":"/audio/b201938cc759f55752b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17167","senseId":"1","lemma":"천","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"천","audio":"/audio/b201938cc759f55752b8.mp3"}},{"text":"원만","meaning":"韩元，韩币","explanation":"원：韩元，韩币；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"원","audio":"/audio/c19fd6787279897c79a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27771","senseId":"1","lemma":"원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"원만","audio":"/audio/ff9e353a87cdd95b6ab0.mp3"}},{"text":"빌려줘.","meaning":"借给我","explanation":"빌려주다 是“借给、借出”；빌려줘 是对熟人提出“借给我”的请求，两个词合起来并非“借入后给”。","readings":[{"term":"빌리다","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3"},{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17824","senseId":"1","lemma":"빌리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빌려줘","audio":"/audio/8d9822f9ca28ee5637e5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b201938cc759f557","term":"천","zh":"千，一千","audio":"/audio/b201938cc759f55752b8.mp3","entryId":"17167","definition":"一百十倍的数量。","pronunciation":["천"]},{"id":"c19fd6787279897c","term":"원","zh":"韩元，韩币","audio":"/audio/c19fd6787279897c79a8.mp3","entryId":"27771","definition":"韩国货币单位。","pronunciation":["원"]},{"id":"7cc8358d972a7f69","term":"빌리다","zh":"借用；与 주다 合用表示借出","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3","entryId":"17824","definition":"单独用时指借用别人的东西；与 주다 组成 빌려주다 时，整体表示借给别人。","pronunciation":["빌리다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给；与 빌리다 合用表示借给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"与 빌리다 组成 빌려주다，表示把自己的东西借给别人。","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio